  "steps": [
    "Cut potatoes into bite-sized cubes; microwave at 600W for 5 minutes.",
    "Cut chicken into strips; chop onion and pepper. Mix soy sauce, honey, cornstarch and 30g water into a sauce.",
    "Fry potatoes in 3g oil on medium-high 4\u20135 minutes until golden. Remove.",
    "Add 2g oil; fry chicken with garlic powder and paprika 2 minutes. Add onion and pepper; fry 2 more minutes.",
    "Return potatoes; add sauce; stir everything 30 seconds until coated and glossy."
